# Marico vs Dabur – Financial Comparison

## Project Overview
A comparative financial analysis of Marico Limited and Dabur India Limited to understand and evaluate their financial performance.

## Objective
To compare the financial performance of two FMCG companies and understand their profitability, financial position, and business performance.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Financial Statement Analysis

## My Work
- Studied the financial statements of both companies.
- Compared key financial indicators and ratios.
- Analyzed profitability and financial performance.
- Examined similarities and differences between the companies.

## Outcome
Developed a better understanding of financial statement analysis, company comparison, and how financial data supports business decision-making.
